@startuml flujo_mqtt_pub_sub
title Flujo MQTT pub/sub — tópicos y QoS

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "ESP32-CAM\n(Publisher + Subscriber)" as ESP
queue "Mosquitto Broker\n:1884" as Broker
component "Backend Flask\n(paho-mqtt)" as BE

note right of ESP
  **Publica:**
  • esp32/imagen/registrar      QoS 1
  • esp32/asistencia/<mac>      QoS 1
  • esp32/heartbeat/<mac>       QoS 0 (cada 30s)

  **Suscrito a:**
  • esp32/respuesta/facial
  • esp32/respuesta/registro
  • esp32/comandos/<mac>

  **Last Will (LWT):**
  • esp32/lwt/<mac> = "offline"
    QoS 1, retained
end note

note left of BE
  **Suscrito a:**
  • esp32/imagen/registrar    QoS 1
  • esp32/asistencia/#        QoS 1
  • esp32/heartbeat/+         QoS 0
  • esp32/lwt/+               QoS 1 (retained)

  **Publica:**
  • esp32/respuesta/facial
  • esp32/respuesta/registro
  • esp32/comandos/<mac>
end note

ESP    -[#2C5282]->     Broker : "1. PUBLISH"
Broker -[#2C5282]->     BE     : "2. forward (match suscripción)"
BE     -[#C53030]up->   Broker : "3. PUBLISH respuesta"
Broker -[#C53030]up->   ESP    : "4. forward"

@enduml
